@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api

### Happy Pay
POST {{base_url}}/collection/1/deck/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

{
  "deckId": "0",
  "name": "Goblins Standard",
  "dateCreated": "2026-08-28",
  "dateUpdated": "2026-08-28"
}

### Bad Path

### Collection does not exist
POST {{base_url}}/collection/999/deck/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

{
  "name": "Goblins Standard",
  "dateCreated": "2026-08-26"
}

### Card Name is empty
POST {{base_url}}/collection/1/deck/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

{
  "name": "",
  "dateCreated": "2026-08-26"
}

### Date Is In Future
POST {{base_url}}/collection/1/deck/1HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

{
  "name": "Goblins Standard",
  "dateCreated": "2075-04-26"
}

### Date Is In Past
POST {{base_url}}/collection/1/deck/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

{
  "name": "Goblins Standard",
  "dateCreated": "1999-04-26"
}

### Add Card to Deck

### Happy Path
POST {{base_url}}/deck/1/card/cultivate
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1","email": "c@c.com"}

{
"deckId": 1,
"name": "My Best Deck",
"dateCreated": "2026-08-28",
"dateUpdated": "2026-08-28"
}

### Bad Path Deck IDs don't match
POST {{base_url}}/deck/999/card/black lotus
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1","email": "[a@a.com](mailto:a@a.com)"}

{
"deckId": 1,
"name": "My Best Deck",
"dateCreated": "2026-08-28",
"dateUpdated": "2026-08-28"
}

### Bad Path dates are in past
POST {{base_url}}/deck/1/card/black lotus
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1","email": "[a@a.com](mailto:a@a.com)"}

{
"deckId": 1,
"name": "My Best Deck",
"dateCreated": "2026-08-20",
"dateUpdated": "2026-08-20"
}

### Bad Path deck name is blank
POST {{base_url}}/deck/1/card/black lotus
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {"id": "1","email": "[a@a.com](mailto:a@a.com)"}

{
"deckId": 1,
"name": "",
"dateCreated": "2026-08-28",
"dateUpdated": "2026-08-28"
}